  <p id="c-zuozhuan-zhushu-002-jin076-roll-close:child" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">其子<persName id="c-zuozhuan-zhushu-002-jin076-roll-close:child:m0002" ref="yt0_0mx_ah5_A">厚</persName>與<persName id="c-zuozhuan-zhushu-002-jin076-roll-close:child:m0004" ref="xrt_zof_cbt_AA">州吁</persName>游，禁之，不可。</p>
